  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joe William Consultancy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CAFOD Sri Lanka Programme Consultant has been associated with CAFOD since 2001.  His connections to state and non-state actors in Sri Lanka, to the diplomatic community, to NGOs engaged in conflict transformation, to UN bodies as well as to regional human rights networks enable CAFOD to maintain an up-to-date analysis of political developments in Sri Lanka and to provide appropriate and timely support to partners.  The Programme Consultant is also registered with the University of Bradford&#x2019;s Peace Studies Centre to undertake a post graduate research degree focused on the Norwegian-facilitated Sri Lanka peace process.  The link with Bradford, a major centre of research on conflict transformation, will also assist CAFOD to develop its priority sector of conflict resolution and peace building (CAFOD 2010).</narrative>
  </description>
